---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: EngineeringImpact[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for planImplementation. Build coordinated implementation packages covering procurement, stock, production, documentation, and field actions as applicable. Sequence changes to avoid incompatible mixed configurations and identify irreversible dispositions requiring separate authorization. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
